 end="00:34.933">felt </span><span begin="00:34.933" end="00:35.165">the </span><span begin="00:35.165" end="00:36.149">earth </span><span begin="00:37.037" end="00:37.661">beneath </span><span begin="00:37.661" end="00:38.485">my </span><span begin="00:38.485" end="00:39.077">feet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.893" end="00:45.021"><span begin="00:39.893" end="00:40.181">Sat </span><span begin="00:40.181" end="00:40.533">by </span><span begin="00:40.533" end="00:40.733">the </span><span begin="00:40.733" end="00:41.573">river </span><span begin="00:41.573" end="00:41.877">and </span><span begin="00:41.877" end="00:42.245">it </span><span begin="00:42.245" end="00:42.581">made </span><span begin="00:42.581" end="00:42.957">me </span><span begin="00:42.957" end="00:45.021">complete</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.503" end="00:50.349"><span begin="00:45.503" end="00:45.806">Oh </span><span begin="00:45.806" end="00:46.349">simple </span><span begin="00:46.349" end="00:47.581">thing </span><span begin="00:48.197" end="00:48.565">where </span><span begin="00:48.565" end="00:48.877">have </span><span begin="00:48.877" end="00:49.149">you </span><span begin="00:49.149" end="00:50.349">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.053" end="00:56.305"><span begin="00:51.053" end="00:51.381">I'm </span><span begin="00:51.381" end="00:52.038">getting </span><span begin="00:52.038" end="00:52.422">old </span><span begin="00:52.422" end="00:52.734">and </span><span begin="00:52.734" end="00:53.094">I </span><span begin="00:53.094" end="00:53.414">need </span><span begin="00:53.414" end="00:54.110">something </span><span begin="00:54.110" end="00:54.465">to </span><span begin="00:54.465" end="00:55.577">rely </span><span begin="00:55.577" end="00:56.305">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.625" end="01:01.442"><span begin="00:56.625" end="00:56.953">So </span><span begin="00:56.953" end="00:57.273">tell </span><span begin="00:57.273" end="00:57.489">m